    "body": "Those implicit aria behaviours are defined in the html-aam specification rather than this one. They should be implemented pretty consistently. The expanded value on the button especially.\n\nWhat popover doesn't do is give imply any semantics itself. So the div with a popover attribute doesn't convey anything specifically beyond what's added to the button. This is what the html spec mentions.",
